Average transverse momentum quantitatively characterizes the slope of the measured \(p_{T}\) spectra of the particles and can be studied in terms of collision energy and centrality. i.e., the transverse dynamics of the particles is reflected in terms of \(\langle p_{T}\rangle\). It is calculated as

